# Robber of the Rich lets Bot1 spend mana "as though it were mana of any color" (CR 609.4b), and colorless is not a color
# (CR 105.2a, 106.1b): a {C} symbol still takes colorless mana. Bot2's Sowing Mycospawn, exiled by the Robber on turn 3,
# costs {4}{G}{C} kicked (its kicker is {1}{C}, CR 107.4c). With exactly six colored mana floating, none of it green, Bot1
# announces the kicker and cannot finish paying: the mana pays nothing of the {C}, the spell is not cast and Bot1 gives it
# up (CR 601.2g-h, 733.1), the Mycospawn back in exile and the pool as it was. With Sol Ring's {C}{C} added, the same cast is
# paid: {C} by colorless mana, and the {G} and the generic mana by mana of other colors.

